 <description>Megalithic Portal data for Google Earth: United_States In-depth information on megaliths, prehistoric and ancient sites of all sorts can be found at The Megalithic Portal and Megalith Map: http://www.megalithic.co.uk . Follow the links for more details of each location. Data is copyright and not to be re-used outside of Google Earth without permission (but you are welcome to ask). This data is provided without any warranty or guarantee of fitness for purpose, and is for personal use only.</description>
