                    <b>Lat:</b> 48.336 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: -92.489<br />
                    Not Known (by us) in .</br>This site was discovered by Bill Lawrence in 1967 while exploring the woods near his grandfather's hunting cabin in St. Louis County, northern Minnesota, USA.  It is a stone...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
